{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/StoreDescHeader.png?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You control a Cyber Seeker.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyber Seekers are bots used to complete high-risk bounties. You are tasked with destroying a legion of bots who have gone rogue and taken over a city. Start every run with limited resources. Receive credits for each bot you destroy and use them to upgrade your bot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/Grapple.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The city is your playground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyber Seekers are equipped with various abilities and can traverse any terrain. Run on walls, grapple, glide and shoot your way through a city under fire. You will find random weapons, ability cards, and programs in each run, making them unique. Choose whatever combination that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/SpiderBot.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle powerful Bots and Mechs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each bot that you destroy raises the alert level. At higher alert levels, you will face tougher enemies, but you will also gain access to powerful weapons. Complete various challenges to raise the alert level and gain credits faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/CombatShotgun.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use modules to gain different abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden within the city are crates containing a unique module or a weapon with random stats. These can give your Cyber Seeker an edge against other bots. Higher-level crates are unlocked when enough bots are destroyed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/Glider.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tons of ways to traverse the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New areas will give you upgrades that will enhance your traversal abilities. But watch out for your bot's integrity. Only a limited number of bots can be deployed per mission, and if all bots are destroyed, the mission will fail, and you will lose all your weapons and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930410?t=1742320197","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2930410?t=1742320197","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/19642a62ef8cb910b5e2fbf44f6118453f9c57ed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742320197","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/19642a62ef8cb910b5e2fbf44f6118453f9c57ed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742320197","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/StoreDescHeader.png?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You control a Cyber Seeker.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyber Seekers are bots used to complete high-risk bounties. You are tasked with destroying a legion of bots who have gone rogue and taken over a city. Start every run with limited resources. Receive credits for each bot you destroy and use them to upgrade your bot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/Grapple.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The city is your playground.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cyber Seekers are equipped with various abilities and can traverse any terrain. Run on walls, grapple, glide and shoot your way through a city under fire. You will find random weapons, ability cards, and programs in each run, making them unique. Choose whatever combination that suits your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/SpiderBot.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Battle powerful Bots and Mechs.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each bot that you destroy raises the alert level. At higher alert levels, you will face tougher enemies, but you will also gain access to powerful weapons. Complete various challenges to raise the alert level and gain credits faster.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/CombatShotgun.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Use modules to gain different abilities.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Hidden within the city are crates containing a unique module or a weapon with random stats. These can give your Cyber Seeker an edge against other bots. Higher-level crates are unlocked when enough bots are destroyed. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/extras/Glider.gif?t=1742320197\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Tons of ways to traverse the city.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New areas will give you upgrades that will enhance your traversal abilities. But watch out for your bot's integrity. Only a limited number of bots can be deployed per mission, and if all bots are destroyed, the mission will fail, and you will lose all your weapons and upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Harsh Agarwal"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2930410/header.jpg?t=1742320197","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"Unauthorized use of this product is strictly prohibited, and such use might be subject to legal action. Further, the user while installing the software, consents that the developer under any circumstances is not liable for any harm caused to the system by use of this software.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257050326,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050326/movie480.mp4?t=1725649575","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050326/movie_max.mp4?t=1725649575"},"name":"Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257050326/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1725649575","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050326/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1725649575","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257050326/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1725649575"}},{"highlight":false,"id":257028120,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028120/movie480.mp4?t=1725649579","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257028120/movie_max.mp4?t=1725649579"},"name":"Docks Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257028120/movie.293x165.jpg?t=1725649579","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.co